# astrion-skill v1
goal: Generate a strong random password and copy to clipboard
trigger:
  - phrase: "generate password"
  - phrase: "new password"
  - phrase: "random password"
do: |
  Parse the user's text for a length (default 20) and optional flags
  ("simple" = letters+digits only; default includes symbols). Generate
  a cryptographically random password via crypto.getRandomValues. Copy
  to clipboard. Show a notification "Password copied (length X). Will
  clear from clipboard in 30 seconds." Auto-clear clipboard after 30s.
constraints:
  level: L2
  budget_tokens: 200
  reversibility: FREE
